reṇukādevī dhyānam(—)
vāme śūla yasmitarorgakaṃ guṇi|(l.)
guṇaaḍimuṇḍī ca bhibhrāṇāṃ karapaṅkajaiḥ||
nāga(…)bhūṣojvalaṃ nānā koyugāntaśadṛśat|
nānā jvalādbhūṣaṇāṃ (*)ukṣālaṃbitavāmapādatim||(*)(l.)
dhṛtāṃ śrīreṇukāmāśrayet|

kālī dhyānam(—)
śyāmāṃ bhīmaraktanetra (*)jvalanaśikhibhujāṃ cāṣṭabhītvā karābhyām|(*)(l.)
śūlaṃ vetālagarbhaṃ ḍamarukasahitaṃ vāmahaste kamaṇḍulam||
anyat ghaṇṭoda(…)(*)analamusala sahitaṃ raudrabhāvaṃ triṇetram|(*)(P.12b,1st line)
cāmuṇḍārūpametat bhuvanava(*)śīka(kha)rīṃ bhadrakālīṃ namostute||(*)(l.)

dvāravasudhātu rasabhūta karagehe| 
pādaravīṣoḍaśa navo navapadaṃ syāt||(l.)
madhye navavedi vrīhī trīṇipadamadhye kuṇḍanamapañca śivamaṇḍapavidhānam|
mānasāre(—)
jyeṣṭamaṇḍapa(*)vistāraṃ dvitrīṇī hastamucyate|(*)(l.)
aṣṭāṣṭastaṃba saṃyuktaṃ kalātā(…)bhavet||
taṃ maṇḍapamadhyetu (*)catustaṃbhaṃ vinirjayet|(*)(l.)
paṅtidvaya karaistārāṃ madhyamaṇḍapakasya tu||
ṣaṭtriṃśat staṃbhasaṃyuktaṃ (*)dharmatāle suniścayam||(*) (P.13a,1st line)
pūrvavat sa(…)tyajet madhye ravihastaṃ suvistaram|
