kanyasaṃ maṇḍapaṃ jñeyaṃ maṇḍapantu  tridhā bhavet|
kāraṇe(—)(l.)
kanyasakriya liṅgānāṃ maṇḍapaṃ kanyasaṃ bhavet||
madhyama triṣuliṅgānāṃ maṇḍapaṃ madhyamaṃ bhavet|(l.)
kuṭaṃ vāpi pravāṃ vāpi maṇḍapaṃ samalaṅkṛtam||
ekāśitipadantu vā madhyādi(…)|(l.)
tanmadhye navapadaṃ vediṣoḍaśaṃ upavedikām||
