somāskandadhyānam(—)
ekānanaṃ vedakaraṃ triṇetraṃ śubhraṃ śuklaṃ sarvavibhūṣaṇāḍhyām|
sa(?)t vidrumābhaṃ kaṭakaṃ bhṛṅgiñca (*)ṭaṅkābhayañcāpī karairvahantam|| (*)(l.) 
vāme tu pātreṃ makarantu dakṣekarṇe jaṭāmakuṭetyarcandram|
laṃbāśayaṃ (*)dakṣiṇavāmapādu somāguhaṃ śubhamahaṃ namāmī||(*)(l.)
savyālaṃbita vāmaśāyitapadaṃ (*)kṛṣṇaṃ mṛgañcābhayam|(*)(l.)
ṭaṅkañcābhiryutaṃ varañca kaṭake bibhrāṇayā vāmake||
vāmelaṃbitanidritānya padayo devyāyuto madhya(…)|(l.)
skandenābjakaradvayena sahītaṃ somāguheśaṃ bhajet||

ekamukhavedakaravidrumanibhāsaṃ (*)kṛṣṇamṛgaṭaṅkavarābhaya|(*)(P.15a,1st line)
catuṣkaṃ locanatritayavastraparīdhānakam||
candrayutamaulīdharagaurīharasūnūm|(l.)

|| ekapādamūrttidhyānam||
triṇetraṃ ekavaktrañca varadābhayahastakam|
ekapādaṃ ṛjuṃ sthitvā śvetapadmāsanasthitam||(l.)

||trimūrtī dhyānam||
raktavaktraṃ triṇetraṃ varadābhayahastakam|
kṛṣṇāparaśu saṃyuktaṃ jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam||(l.)
ṛjvāgatasthītekena pādenāpīsamanvitam|
kaṭīpradeśādūrdhve tu brahmāviṣṇu dvikāryut||(l.)
ha(a)ñjalīkṛtahastau tu varahastau tu pūrvavat|
trimūrttiṃ ekaraṃ (…) triṇetraṃ ekavaktrakam|| (P.15b,1st line)
kaṇṭhau makara citreṇa jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam|
agrasthau śaṅkha cakreṇa savyavāmegaṇḍikau||
yugmapādāṅghrī(*)padmastau trimūrdhnīmabhidhīyate|(*)(l.)

sukhāsanadhyānam(—)
āsanetu sukhāsīnaṃ bhṛṅgīparaśudhāriṇīm|(l.)
abhayaṃ dakṣiṇe haste varadaṃ vāmahastake||
kaṭakaṃ vā sukhāsīnaṃ umāskando ca varjayet|

dakṣiṇāmūrttidhyānam(—)(l.)
mudrāpo(pu)stakavahnīnāgavilasat pāśaṃ prasannānanam|
muktāhāravibhūṣaṇaṃ śaśikalā(*)bhāsvat kirīṭojvalam||(*)(l.)
ajñānāpahamādimādimāgamagirāṃ arthaṃ bhavānīpatīm|
nyagrodhāntaravāsinaṃ suragurūṃ dhyāyedabhiṣṭāptaye|| (P.16a,1st line) 

dhavalassucitagātraṃ sarpayajñopavītam|
analasahitahastam akṣamālādharāntam||
sphuritakanakavīnāṃ kuñcitaphālanetram| (l.)
girivaraśiśirastaṃ dakṣiṇāmūrttimīḍhe||


liṅgodbhavadhyānam(—)
līṅgākṛtyordhvajātaḥ brahmā haṃsa(*)rūpaṃ vidhāya ca|(*)(l.)
viṣṇuḥ varāharūpaṃ tu liṅgasyātha prakalpayet||
kṛtāñjalī samāyuktau brahmā viṣṇuśca pārśvayoḥ|(l.)
liṅgamadhye tu prakarttavyaṃ pūrvavaccandraśekharam||

gaurī dhyānam(—)
śyāmāṃ dvinetrāṃ (*)dvibhujāṃ tribhaṅgim|(*)(l.)
savyāpasavyasthitakuñcitakuñcitāṅghrim||
savyotpalāsā kaṭaka..vāme|
hastāvalambaparameśvarī cā(?)||(P.16b,1st line)
 
dvinetrāṃ dvibhujāṃ śyāmāṃ gaurīṃ dakṣīkarotpalām|
karaṇḍamakuṭopetāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām|| (l.)
kirīṭamakuṭāṃ vāpī keśabaddhamathāpivā|
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktāṃ vāme lambakarānvitām||(l.)
bhujadvayaṃ samāyuktāṃ prasāryeka karānvitām|
savyotpaladharāṃ devīṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām||(l.)
karaṇḍamakuṭopetāṃ netradvayasamanvitām|
śyāmavarṇasamāyuktāṃ āsīnaṃ vāstī tantu vā||
i(ba)ddharūpāṃ (*)parāṃ gaurīṃ bhāvayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ|(*)(l.)
nādukulavasanopetāṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitām||
sarvāvayavasaṃpūrṇāṃ (*)sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyutām|(*)(P.17a,1st line)
dakṣiṇe kaṭakaṃ vāpī vāmahastapralaṃbitām||
abhayasya vaśāt tatra lū(le)payet sūtramādarāt|(l.)
gauryākṛtīvalamevantu(?) bhāvayettu vicakṣaṇaḥ||
śaṃbhuśatni samabhaṅgamucyate|
tatrivaktra prakṛtīñca susnītam|| 
laṃbamevakarandakṣiṇotpalaṃ lañjabhāvamanasāravaktrakam|

sadāśiva dhyānam(—)
śuddhasphaṭikasaṅkāśaṃ dvātriṃśat lakṣaṇānvitam|
padmāsanastaṃ(sthaṃ) pañcāsyaṃ prativaktraṃ trilocanam||
dṛkriyābhirviśālākṣaṃ jñānacandrakalānvitam|
dhavale(…)vadanaṃ pītaṃ tatpuruṣānanam||(P.17b,1st line)
kṛṣṇāghoramukhopetaṃ raktābhoktaravaktrakam|
suśvetaṃ paścimāsyaikaṃ sadyojātaṃ prakīrtitam||
nāgopavītinaṃ śāntaṃ jaṭākhaṇḍendumaṇḍitam|
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ divyapuṣpairalaṅkṛtam||
śaktyāsīśūlakhaḍvāṅgaṃ varavyagrakarāṃbhujaiḥ|
dakṣiṇe tathā vāma(ha)staiḥ ḍamarūṃ bījapūrakam|
nāgākṣasūtranīlābjaṃ bibhrāṇaṃ pañcabhiḥkaraiḥ||

kundendu sphaṭikābhāsaṃ jaṭājaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam|
pañcamūrdhni(rddha) samāyuktaṃ pañcavaktrasamanvitam||
vaktraṃ prativiśeṣeṇa trilocanasamanvitam|
daśabhujaṃ tanūrekaṃ dvipādaṃ padmasaṃsthitam||(P.18a,1st line)
triśūlaṃ paraśuṃ khaḍgaṃ vaktrābhayau ca dakṣiṇe|
nāgāṃ pa(pā)śāṅkuśañcaiva ghaṇṭāvahnīñca vāmake||(l.)
sarvālaṅkārasaṃyuktaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam|
divyāṃbaradharandevaṃ dīrghabāhuṃ trilocanam||
divyagandhānuliptāṅgaṃ divyamālāvibhūṣitam|
śāntarūpamidaṃ syāt kiñcibṛhasitānanam||
etadrūpaṃ smaret nityaḥ dharmakāmyārthasiddhidam|

vyaktasadāśivadhyānam(—)
vaktraṃ pratijaṭācūṭaṃ (*)candrārdhakṛtaśekharam|(*)(P.18bF.11,1st line)
dehaṃ(?)pañcasaṃyuktaṃ caraṇadvayasaṃyuktam||
tasyapūrvamukhaṃ śubhraṃ kapolalohitādharam|
jāṃbunada pratīkāśaṃ kalpayettu bhujadvayam||
dakṣahaste akṣasūtrañca vāmetu būjapūrakam|
dakṣam añjanasaṅkāśaṃ vyāvṛtāsya śaśāṅkam||
vyālabandhajaṭācūṭaṃ kapolatalasaṃyutam|
tuṅgāgrasmaśru saṃyuktaṃ śūlaghaṇcākaradvayam||
uttaraṃ vāmavaktrantu ḍāḍimīkusumaprabham|
bhūṣaṇaṃ pracaraṃ vaktraṃ yodviktra samanvitam||
paraśotpala hastāḍhyaṃ paścīme rajitaḥ prabham|
bālaveṣasamāyuktaṃ puṇḍarīkanilabhakṣaṇam||
abhayaṃ varadopetaṃ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam|
pañcamaṃ sphaṭikaprakhyaṃ atiśāntaṃ sma(smi)taunanam||(P.19a,1st line)
īśānamūrdhauvaktrasyāt karau kaṭakabhūṣitau|
iddhaṃ vaktrasamāyuktaṃ vaktravarṇānulepanam||
kalāvassa(…)dehāḍhyaḥ sarvābharaṇabhūṣitam|
sarvakāmapradaṃ śāntaṃ dvātriṃśallakṣaṇānvitam||
īśānandehakaraṇaṃ (*)kalpayet dvārasaṃmukham|(*)()
bhuktimukti prasidhyarthaṃ tattatkarmānurūpataḥ||
saṃsthānaṃ varṇadivyāstraṃ dvārānyeva prakalpayet|
kuryādīśānadehantu darśatāloktameva ca||
purūṣapramukhādehāḥ īśadehārthamātrataḥ|

parāśakti dhyānam(—)
caturbhujāṃ triṇetrāñca suprasanneka(nnāṃ eka)vaktrakām|
mukulavasanāṃ devīṃ karaṇḍamakuṭānvitām||
varadābhayasaṃyuktāṃ pāśāṅkuśakarānvitām|
(…) kotpalakarāṃ vāpī śūlapāśakarāpivā||
yatheṣṭāstra vivāśaṅkhaṃ cakrahastau tu ṣaḍbhujām|
daṃṣṭrākarālavadanā pañcāsya daśadoryutā||
devoktāstrāsanaṃ vāpi devāliṅganatatparām|
devorūsaṃsthitāvāpi sthānakāsana saṃyutā||
pralaṃbavāmapādā vā laṃbitā vāmapādukā|
(P.20  a,bl.ked)(P.20b,a1st line)
(side heading)(pañcaviṃśatī mūrttī dhyānam)
prathamaṃ somadhārīca dvitīyaṃ umayāsahā|
tritīyaṃ vṛṣabhārūḍhaṃ caturthaṃ nṛttarūpa(…)||
vāhyaṃ pañcamaṃ (*)vidyāt ṣaṣṭhaṃ bhikṣāṭanaṃ tathā|(*)()
kāmārīṃ saptamaṃ vidyāt kālahācāṣṭamaṃ bhavet||
navamaṃ tripurārīṃ syāt jalandharavayodaśa|
ekādaśaṃ gajārīṃ syāt dvādaśaṃ vīrabhadrakam||
trayodaśaṃ harerdhaṃ ardhanārī caturdaśam|
pā(pa)ñcādaśaṃ kirātaṃ syāt kaṅkālaṃ śoḍaśaṃ bhavet||
caṇḍeśānugrahañcaiva tataḥ saptādaśo bhavet|
viṣāpaharaṇañcaiva aṣṭādaśamitismṛtam||
cakradānasvarūpantu ekonaviṃśati smṛtam|
vighnaprasādaviṃśaśca somāskandamataḥ param||
dvāviṃśat ekapādaṃ syāt trayoviṃśat (*)sukhāsanam|(*)(P.21a,1st line)
dakṣiṇāmūrtti rūpantu caturviṃśat prakīrttitam||
liṅgodbhava svarūpantu pañcaviṃśatibhedakam|()
ete maheśvararūpāṇi mūrttībhedā prakīrtitāḥ||

candraśekharadhyānam(—)
vipulavadana netraṃ saumyaśriṅgārabhāvaḥ|
abhayavaradahastaṃ candrapiṃbāgamaulīm||
ṛjutarasamapādaṃ sthānakaṃ vidrumābham|
hariṇaparaśudhāraṃ padmapīṭhoparisam||
ṛjutvākṛtisthītaṃ devaṃ kṛṣṇāparaśū saṃyutam|
varadābhayahastāñca jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam||
divyacarmāṃbaradharaṃ saumyaṃ dṛṣṭī smītīnanam|
umayāsaha karttavyaṃ induśekharamūrttinam||

āliṅgacandraśekharadhyānam(—)(P. 21b, 1st line)
kevalaṃ gaurī saṃyuktaṃ(…)hajaṃ  gaurī saṃyutam|
āliṅgamekahastena devī devo purassaram||
kṛtāmāliṅgamākhyātam evaṃ trividhamucyate|
kevalaṃ samapādantu sthānakaṃ sahajaṃ tathā|| 
samabhaṅgādī bhaṅgāvāpyāliṅga candraśekharam|

umāyāsaha dhyānam(—)
dhavalābha sukhāsana devīyutam|
hariṇī mṛgaṭaṅkavarābhayadam||
sumukhīkaramutpala dhṛgvaradam|
umayāsahadevasvarūpamidam||

ūrdhvatāṇḍava dhyānam(—)
kālīpratijñā saṃvāde abha(pa)smāreparīsthitam|
dakṣiṇaṃ kuñcitaṃ pādaṃ vāmapādaśirodhṛdam||
smitānanaṃ triṇetrañcahastadvādaśa locanam|
vyāghrājīnāṃbapadharaṃ bhasmoddhūlitavigraham||
piṅgābhañca jaṭāyuktaṃ (*)bakapakṣopaśobhitam|(*)(P.22a,1st line)
durdhūrañcārkapuṣpañcā bālacandrasamanvitam||
vāmahastaśirodūrdhvaṃ savye kaṭaka laṃbanam|
śūlabāṇagadākhaḍgaṃ ghaṇṭāhastañca dakṣiṇe||
kapālapāśaḍamarūñca dhenuṃṃ nāgañca vāmake|
ūrdhvatāṇgavasamākhyātaṃ kālīṃ lajjāsamanvitam||

ekavaktraṃ triṇetrañca jaṭāmakuṭamaṇḍitam|
dakṣiṇaṃ kuñcitaṃ pādaṃ apasmāropasthitam||
vāmapādaṃ śirordhvaṃ syāt vāmahastaṃ śiropari|
abhayaṃ śūlahastañca ḍamarūṃ śālavādyakam||
bhujaṅgavahnīkaṭakam (*)aṣṭahastairalaṅkṛtam|(*)(P. 22b, 1st line)

bhikṣāṭanadhyānam(—)
agnīmūrttikapālañca śūlahastasamanvitam|
ḍamarūṃ mṛga āsyena tṛṇadāna samāyutam||
sarvalakṣaṇasaṃyuktaṃ bhasmasarvairalaṅkṛtam|
pādukena samāyukto sarvabhūtasamāvṛtam||
kuṇḍodarasamāyuktaṃ bhikṣāṭanamaheśvaram|

kāmārī dhyānam(—)
ugrarūpantu kāmārī caturbhuja samanvitam|
kṛṣṇāṭaṅkasamāyuktaṃ abhayaṃ varadānvitam||
karyakāmārī puṃhyevaṃ vakṣehaṃ kālanāśanam|
devyālokanatatparaṃ trinayanaṃ virāsahādhyāsītam|
mudrāṭaṅkakaraṃ gajānu vilasat (*)bāhu prasannānanam||(*)(P.23a,1st line)
kaṭyābaddha bhujaṅgamaṃ munivrataṃ vandesmarārīṃ haram|
bhasmoddhūlitavigrahaṃ śaśidharaṃ veṇījaṭāmaṇḍitam||
ṭaṅkaṃ kṛṣṇamṛgaṃ dadhānamamalaṃ vīrāsane saṃsthitam|
aṅgesavyataloparī karatalaṃ vinyasyasvayogīśvaram||
vyāghratvāśvasanaṃ lalāṭajadṛśāṃ kāmārīṃ smareśaṃ bhajet|

kālanāśadhyānam(—)
caturbhujaṃ triṇetrañca dvibhujaṃ vā viśeṣataḥ|
dakṣīṇe tu kare śūlaṃ vāmasūcyāṅgulī smṛtam||
abhayaṃ varadaṃ vāpī ūruhastaṃ viśeṣataḥ|
devasyavāmapādena mardanaṃ kālanāśanam||
niśītaparaśuhastaṃ saṅgrahīta triśūlam|
karabhūtandṛḍapāśastarjanī lakṣyamṛrtyuḥ||
mūrtī ca kīrta(…)patyaṃ trātumicchāmi caṇḍoḥ|
mama ra(…)samadharakṣan vāmapādena kāle||

tripurāntakadhyānam(—)
triṇetraṃ ekavaktrañca jaṭākhaṇḍandumaṇḍitam|
vāmakarṇe tu patrañcā dakṣiṇonakrakuṇḍalam||
savyavāmadhanurbāṇaṃ mṛgaṃ paraśudhāriṇam|
savye tu kuñcitāṅghriśca apare sthitapādukam||
evantripurasaṃhāraṃ koṭīsūryasamaprabham|
dhanurbāṇasamāyuktaṃ kṛṣṇaṃ paraśusaṃyutam||
umayāsahitaṃ kāryaṃ evaṃ vai tripurāntakam|

jalandharasaṃhāradhyānam(—)
ratnābhaṃ ugrarūpantu caturbhujasamanvitam|
ṭaṅkañca cakrahariṇeṃ halapallavadhāriṇam||
evaṃ vīrākṛtīṃ proktaṃ dakṣayajñavināśanam|


vīrabhadradhyānam(—)
vīrabhadrasvarūpantu nīlavarṇaṃ caturbhujam|
khaḍgañca kheṭakañcāpi parikhaṃ vāpi viśṣataḥ||
pārśvahaste dharaṃ proktaṃ bāṇakārmukamevaca|
raktavastrasamāyuktaṃ vīranūpura saṃyuktam||
śobhitaṃ yajñopavītasaṃyuktaṃ karaṇḍamakuṭānvitam|
śīrṣake liṅgabandhañca dakṣabhāgevīthikramam||
vāmecandrasamāyuktaṃ itirejānhavīdharam| 

rājasañcogranetrañca sudaṃṣṭraṃ bhīmarūpakam||
svastīdaṃ dakṣiṇaṃ pādaṃ vāmapādantu kuñcitam|
śiromālāvibhūṣañca cchinnavīrasamāvratam||
sarvābharaṇasaṃyuktaṃ dvātriṃśat lakṣaṇānvitam|

harihara dhyānam(—)
vāmapārśve hariṃ kuryāt dakṣiṇe rudrameva cā|
harīṃ varadaṃ cakrañca rudraṃ paraśu sābhayam||
pītāṃbaradharaṃ viṣṇuṃ vyāpyacarmāṃbaraṃ haram|
viṣṇuṃ kirīṭasaṃyuktaṃ śaṅkarantu jaṭānvitam||
śyāmavarṇaṃ harīñcaiva śaṅkaraṃ raktarūpiṇam|

ardhanārīśvaradhyānam(—)
dakṣiṇaṃ kuñcitaṃ pādaṃ vāmapādaṃ ṛjusthitam|
ardhakāyanaronārī kramaṃ kuryāt dvibhaṅgakam||
harasyadakṣiṇe haste korparaṃ vṛṣamastake|
prakoṣṭapṛṣṭa saṃyuktaṃ utpalaṃ paraśudhāriṇam||
vāme varadahastantu jaṭābakasamanvitam|
śyāmavarṇaṃ umādevīṃ raktavarṇo hastathā||
vyāghracarmāṃbaradharaṃ pārvatīkṣemavāsasam|
evaṃ dhyātvā viśeṣeṇa pūjākāle kṛtaṃ yajet||
nārīkaśyāmaraktavarṇā kalhāraṭaṅkābhayadāna hastā|
vāmastanī candradharā triṇetrā kṣaumañjīnābhyastita mūrttirīḍhyāḥ||

kirātamūrttidhyānam(—)
raktābhaṃ dvibhujaṃ dhanuḥ śaradhṛtam|
muktālakaṃ sustitaṃ bhīmākṣadvayasaṃyutam||
vipulasadvyakṣasya vīsthīrṇakam|
maulau puṣpakakarṇabhūṣaṇadharam||
śārdula carmāṃbaraṃ baddhau pānaharājitadvayapadam|
dhyāyet kirītaṃ bhaje||

kaṅkālamūrttidhyānam(—)
pādau paiduka saṃyuktaṃ caturdobhiḥ samanvitam|
yajñasūtraṃ suśāntañca sumukhañca suśobhitam||
āṅgardhakṣaśura(…)samyak ardhendumakuṭojvalam|
dakṣiṇaṃ kuñcitaṃ pādaṃ vāmapādantu susti(sthi)tam||
samabhaṅgāvato vāpi kāntiyukta nijāṅgakam|
paraharaṃ dakṣiṇe haste ḍiṇḍi vāme tu pūrvayoḥ||
savyamadhyāgra śūlāgrantu kṛṣṇajihvāgra saṃyutam|
vāme kara pare piñce daṇḍakaṃ (*)kālakarṇakam||(*) (P. 26a,1st line)

caṇḍeśānugrahadhyānam (—) (?) (P. 26b,1st line)

japākusumasaṅkāśaṃṃ kāśyapeyaṃ mahādyutim|
tamoriṃ sarvapāpaghnaṃ praṇatosmī divākaram||
dadhiśaṅkha duṣālābhaṃ kṣīrodārṇava(…)bhavam|
kumāmīśaśītaṃ somaṃ śaṃbharmakuṭabhūṣaṇam||
dharaṇīgarbhasaṃbhūtaṃ vidyut kāñjanasannibham|
kumāraṃ śaktihastantaṃ maṅgalaṃ praṇamāmyaham||
priyaṅgukalikābhāsaṃ rūpeṇā pratimaṃ budhaiḥ|
saumyaṃ saumyaguṇopetaṃ namāmīśaśinaṃ budhaiḥ||
devānāñca ṛṣīṇāñca guruṃ kāñcanasannibham|
vandanīyaṃ trilokeśaṃ taṃ namāmi bṛhaspatim||
hemakuṃbhaṃ mṛḍālābhaṃ daityānāṃ paramaṃ gurum|
sarvaśāstrapravaktāraṃ bhārgavaṃ praṇamāmyaham||
nirañjanasamābhāsaṃ raviputro mahāgraham (yamāgrajam)|
chāyāmārttāṇḍa saṃbhūtaṃ taṃnamāmi śanaiścaram||
ardhakāyaṃ mahāvīryaṃ candrāditya vimardanam|
pīḍitaṃ siṃhikābhūtaṃ taṃ rāhuṃ praṇamāmyaham||
palālayūmasaṅkāśaṃ tārakāgrahamastakam|
(…………) ghoraṃ taṃ ketuṃ praṇamāmyaham||
