anantarūpaviśvātmā rakṣamāṃ (*)bhavasāgarāt||(*)(l.)
mantrapuṣpaṃ samarpayāmī|| 

agnigarbha śamīgarbha devagarbha prajāpate| 
hiraṇyagarbha (*)śrīgarbha yajñagarbhanamostu te||(*)(l.)
pradakṣiṇaṃ samarpayāmī||


